StrokeFill3D preprocessing assets
===============================

SynthStrip
----------
The PyTorch brain-extraction implementation follows the published SynthStrip v1
architecture and preprocessing conventions. The official model weights are
retrieved from the authors; they are not committed to this repository. The
provider offers the weights under the MIT license or CC BY 4.0.
https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/docs/synthstrip/

Please cite: Hoopes A, Mora JS, Dalca AV, Fischl B, Hoffmann M.
SynthStrip: Skull-Stripping for Any Brain Image. NeuroImage 260 (2022), 119474.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2022.119474

